    "Source table and JSON disagree for Mercy staff x: 0.12 versus 0.08. Table includes Illari; JSON includes Sojourn at (0.15,0.13). Neither variant is silently selected as current truth.",
    "Footnotes: Hanzo arrow tip; Zenyatta behind interlaced fingers; Roadhog between barrels; Doomfist left hand; Lifeweaver Blossom middle-finger tip or Thorn Volley inner-palm centre; Juno muzzle.",
    "Source JSON has missing commas and snippet has missing End; do not paste those examples without repair."
